            </p>

            <!-- Bouton Téléchargement -->
            <div style="margin: 20px 0; text-align: center;">
                <a href="PDF_GO_DOC-20261024-WA0009.pdf" download style="display: inline-block; background-color: #27ae60; color: white; padding: 12px 25px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">
